WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.874
Video 3. Tally maathi ek step ma switch karo.

00:00:05.074 --> 00:00:11.692
Pehla, fakt ek vaar TallyPrime ma: eno XML
port chalu karo.

00:00:11.622 --> 00:00:15.575
F1 dabavo, pachhi Settings, pachhi
Connectivity.

00:00:15.505 --> 00:00:23.270
"TallyPrime acts as" ma Both rakho. Port 9000
rakho, ane Ctrl+A dabavo.

00:00:23.199 --> 00:00:28.344
Pachhi TallyPrime bandh karo, fari chalu karo,
ane tamari company kholo.

00:00:28.644 --> 00:00:35.052
Have Hisaab kholo. Nava PC ma, Select Company
ma Switch from Tally dekhay chhe.

00:00:35.082 --> 00:00:40.102
E Import menu ma pan chhe. Gateway par, Alt+O
dabavo.

00:00:40.726 --> 00:00:46.892
Switch from Tally maate W dabavo. Hisaab tarat
TallyPrime shodhe chhe.

00:00:46.922 --> 00:00:53.778
Esc dabavo to search dekhay chhe. Hisaab e aa
PC ma ane office network ma joyu.

00:00:53.808 --> 00:01:02.475
Aa video ma, test Tally port 9260 par javab aape chhe.
Tamaru TallyPrime port 9000 vapre chhe.

00:01:02.505 --> 00:01:11.244
Enter dabavo: TallyPrime ma khulli darek company dekhay
chhe, ena GSTIN, dates ane vouchers sathe.

00:01:12.324 --> 00:01:18.042
Hisaab company tick kare chhe. Space thi
company tick ke untick thay chhe.

00:01:18.072 --> 00:01:21.194
Enter dabavo, ane Yes maate fari Enter.

00:01:22.572 --> 00:01:31.171
Hisaab pehla masters, pachhi vouchers copy kare chhe. Esc
thi atke chhe, ane tyare kai save thatu nathi.

00:01:31.651 --> 00:01:37.589
Parinaam: 60 masters ane 12 vouchers, 51
milliseconds ma.

00:01:37.519 --> 00:01:45.099
Pachhi Hisaab, Tally na potana reports saame 46 lines
check kare chhe. Badhi 46 match thay chhe.

00:01:45.298 --> 00:01:51.955
Hisaab, Tally maathi fakt vaanche chhe. Tamaro
Tally data jem chhe tem j rahe chhe.

00:01:51.885 --> 00:01:58.323
Darek company, Hisaab ma navi company bane
chhe. TallyPrime, PC par rahi shake chhe.

00:01:58.523 --> 00:02:04.732
Tamari company, Hisaab ma aavi gai. Aagal na
video ma Proof of Match joishu.

